{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Want to skip to the implementation? Check out these examples:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/react/examples/row-pinning","children":[{"type":"text","value":"row-pinning"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../api/features/row-pinning","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Row Pinning API"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"row-pinning-guide","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Row Pinning Guide"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"There are 2 table features that can reorder rows, which happen in the following order:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Row Pinning"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - If pinning, rows are split into top, center (unpinned), and bottom pinned rows."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../guide/sorting","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sorting"}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"api","text":"API","level":2},{"id":"row-pinning-guide","text":"Row Pinning Guide","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Examples\n\nWant to skip to the implementation? Check out these examples:\n\n- [row-pinning](../framework/react/examples/row-pinning)\n\n## API\n\n[Row Pinning API](../api/features/row-pinning)\n\n## Row Pinning Guide\n\nThere are 2 table features that can reorder rows, which happen in the following order:\n\n1. **Row Pinning** - If pinning, rows are split into top, center (unpinned), and bottom pinned rows.\n2. [Sorting](../guide/sorting)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Row Pinning Guide\n---\n\n## Examples\n\nWant to skip to the implementation? Check out these examples:\n\n- [row-pinning](../framework/react/examples/row-pinning)\n\n## API\n\n[Row Pinning API](../api/features/row-pinning)\n\n## Row Pinning Guide\n\nThere are 2 table features that can reorder rows, which happen in the following order:\n\n1. **Row Pinning** - If pinning, rows are split into top, center (unpinned), and bottom pinned rows.\n2. [Sorting](../guide/sorting)\n"}
